		<h1 class="entry-title">Table of Contents 目次</h1>	</header>
	<div class="entry-content">
		
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">The website is undergoing a full-fledged remodel project in which every page will at some point be remastered. Certain features being implemented include:<br><br>1. Footnotes to prevent extra information from getting in the way.<br>2. While downloading <a href="https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/rikaikun/jipdnfibhldikgcjhfnomkfpcebammhp?hl=ja&amp;pli=1" data-type="link" data-id="https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/rikaikun/jipdnfibhldikgcjhfnomkfpcebammhp?hl=ja&amp;pli=1">Rikaikun</a> and/or <a href="https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/yomitan/likgccmbimhjbgkjambclfkhldnlhbnn" data-type="link" data-id="https://chromewebstore.google.com/detail/yomitan/likgccmbimhjbgkjambclfkhldnlhbnn">Yomitan</a> is recommended, furigana will be implemented when I have time to add them. <br>3. Many new lessons added every year, covering existing and new topics in greater detail. <br><br>Lessons that have already been remastered once but are open for user feedback and text revisions are highlighted in light grey. For all other lessons, please refrain from reporting issues, as I have not yet had the chance to get to them thoroughly.<br><br>As we are updating and adding more functionality to the side bar, the Table of Contents shown here is the most up-to-date at all times. Please do not report mismatching numbers or titles between this page and the side bar. We know.</p>



<div class="wp-block-group"><div class="wp-block-group__inner-container is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained">
<h3 class="wp-block-heading">Beginners 1</h3>



<div class="wp-block-group is-vertical is-content-justification-left is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-df7bfe9b wp-block-group-is-layout-flex">
<div class="wp-block-group is-vertical is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-4fc3f8e1 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex">
<p class="wp-block-paragraph"><mark style="background-color:#e1dfdc" class="has-inline-color">第0課: <a href="https://imabi.org/what-is-japanese/">Introduction to Japanese</a></mark><mark style="background-color:#26866d" class="has-inline-color"><br></mark><mark style="background-color:#e1dfdc" class="has-inline-color">第1課: <a href="https://imabi.org/pronunciation-i/">Vowels</a><br>第2課: <a href="https://imabi.org/pronunciation-ii%e3%80%80%e6%97%a5%e6%9c%ac%e8%aa%9e%e3%81%ae%e7%99%ba%e9%9f%b3%e2%91%a1/">Consonants</a><br>第3課: <a href="https://imabi.org/pronunciation-iii-%e6%97%a5%e6%9c%ac%e8%aa%9e%e3%81%ae%e7%99%ba%e9%9f%b3%e2%91%a2/">Pitch Accent &amp; Devoicing</a><br>第4課:&nbsp;<a href="https://imabi.org/hiragana%e3%80%80%e3%81%b2%e3%82%89%e3%81%8c%e3%81%aa/">Hiragana&nbsp;ひらがな</a><br>第5課:&nbsp;<a href="https://imabi.org/katakana%e3%80%80%e3%82%ab%e3%82%bf%e3%82%ab%e3%83%8a/">Katakana&nbsp;カタカナ</a><br>第6課:&nbsp;<a href="https://imabi.org/kana-iii-orthography%e3%80%80%e4%bb%ae%e5%90%8d%e9%81%a3%e3%81%84/">Kana&nbsp;Orthography</a><br>第7課: <a href="https://imabi.org/kanji-intro-i%e3%80%80%e6%bc%a2%e5%ad%97%e5%85%a5%e9%96%80%e2%91%a0/">Introduction to&nbsp;Kanji&nbsp;漢字 I</a><br>第8課: <a href="https://imabi.org/kanji-intro-ii%e3%80%80%e6%bc%a2%e5%ad%97%e5%85%a5%e9%96%80%e2%91%a1/">Introduction to Kanji 漢字 II</a><br>第9課: <a href="https://imabi.org/nouns-and-pronouns%e3%80%80%e5%90%8d%e8%a9%9e%e3%81%a8%e4%bb%a3%e5%90%8d%e8%a9%9e/">Nouns &amp; Pronouns</a><br>第10課: <a href="https://imabi.org/copular-sentences-i%e3%80%80%e3%82%b3%e3%83%94%e3%83%a5%e3%83%a9%e6%96%87%ef%bc%88%e6%99%ae%e9%80%9a%e4%bd%93%ef%bc%89/">Copular Sentences I: Plain Speech</a><br>第11課: <a href="https://imabi.org/copular-sentences-ii%e3%80%80%e3%82%b3%e3%83%94%e3%83%a5%e3%83%a9%e6%96%87%ef%bc%88%e4%b8%81%e5%af%a7%e4%bd%93%ef%bc%89/">Copular Sentences II: Polite Speech</a><br>第12課: <a href="https://imabi.org/the-particle-ga-i%e3%80%80%e6%a0%bc%e5%8a%a9%e8%a9%9e%e3%80%8c%e3%81%8c%e3%80%8d%e2%91%a0/" data-t